Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:17.01,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,此地不宜久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一还有狙击手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there's another sniper?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,木板可挡不住子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wood pallet won't stop one of those rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连出去都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't even go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少白天不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克说不逃 那我们就不逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick says we're not running, we're not running.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.67,0:00:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好么 好死不如赖活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, better to live like rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何高见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我看 咱们昨晚如果溜出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we should have slid out of here last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能苟活几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lived to fight another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但已错过机会 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we lost that window, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在外面肯定到处都是他的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he's got scouts on every road out of this place by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才不怕那个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't scared of that prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天安排卡车冲过围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That truck through the fence thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是给我们点厉害瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's just him ringing the doorbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们有坚固的堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might have some thick walls to hide behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.95,0:00:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也敌不过他的武器和人马\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's got the guns and the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他占领了附近的高地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he takes the high ground around this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就完了 他想饿死我们都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}shoot, he could just starve us out if he wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他关到别的牢笼去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put him in the other cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 他说的有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你 全是你惹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all you. You started this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是追究责任的时候 关键是怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What difference whose fault it is? What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.63,0:01:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said we should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿克塞尔死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Axel's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.07,0:01:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你状态越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're slipping, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都看到了 我们也理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all seen it. We understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.68,0:01:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾说别想要民主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once said this isn't a democracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.66,0:01:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你必须身体力行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you have to own up to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将一家老小的性命交予你手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put my family's life in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get your head clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.87,0:01:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出点行动来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我枪法不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.39,0:02:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.39,0:02:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说句话 你能保证不生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I say something, will you promise not to be mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我们的首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让赫谢尔和达里尔来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Hershel and Daryl handle things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.19,0:03:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该歇一歇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有多少人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many does that give us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,20个 还有些人患慢性疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}20. We have several people with chronic conditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听觉障碍 关节炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}hearing impairments, arthritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果加上他们 共26人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adding those gives us 26.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把13岁以上的全加上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we include men and women age 13 and up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,连孩子也算上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean boys and girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.89,0:04:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是青少年 用这个词更妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adolescence… it's a 20th century invention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一共多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,35人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:05:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们都配好武器和弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, make sure they all have sidearms and plenty of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁内斯就绪后 就开始训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start training when Martinez is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了监狱的事 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this I hear about the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你不会去骚扰他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were gonna leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会报复他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.59,0:05:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是去谈判的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门外有那么多行尸就够糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad enough we got biters at our gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再添个只有数里间隔的侵略者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have aggressors just miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是去打个善意的招呼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you went and welcomed them to the neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们对我们开火了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they shot at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们在一起时他们是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who these people were when you were with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们现在变了 变得残忍嗜杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they've changed. They're bloodthirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was informed this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把他牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drag him into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对 这是咱们俩之间的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. This is between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是烦透了 受够了你的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of this. Sick of the lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会眼睁睁看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna watch this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个镇和我的朋友们相互残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my friends gun each other down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean it's too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你想要证明什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're trying to prove,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,适可而止吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我们的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我们全部体格健全的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are all the able-bodied people we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会装备武器 接受训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna carry arms and receive training.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会再被突然袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't get caught sleeping again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}One car, that is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,路被堵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The roads are blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都差点回不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We barely made it back ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢去监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go to that prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚只有14岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah's only 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:06:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有哮喘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? He has asthma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.87,0:07:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑不了十米就喘不过来气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't run more than 10 yards before losing his breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他能有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good is that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督让所有能拿枪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor wants everyone who can hold a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在到市政厅前集合 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in front of the town hall now. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚 你得制止这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, you have to straighten this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想让诺亚去打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want Noah to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说要打仗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's talking about fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该教大家如何自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be teaching people to defend themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是组建一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}not raising an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,自卫的唯一方法就是组建军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to defend ourselves is with an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细监视 眼睛睁大 脑袋放低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take watch. Eyes open, head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,广场上都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Field's filled with walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没发现外面有狙击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't see any snipers out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是玛姬要继续放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll keep Maggie on watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去哨塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get up in the guard tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭一半行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}take out half them walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们趁机修补围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}give these guys a chance to fix the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者开几辆车把巴士放好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or use some of the cars to put the bus in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用光子弹我们拿不下广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't access the field without burning through our bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们困在这了 食物和弹药所剩无几\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're trapped in here. There's barely any food or ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前就短缺过 会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been here before. We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候这里只有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when it was just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.34,0:07:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有毒蛇混在我们中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before there was a snake in the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:08:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 还要再说一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we gonna go through this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔就住在这 他现在和我们一伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Merle's staying here. He's with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 习惯一下吧 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get used to it. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为莫尔可以住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Merle living here is really gonna fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能把他赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't kick him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩试图杀你后 你会和他共处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't ask you to live with Shane after he tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔服过役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle has military experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许不守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may be erratic,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不要低估他对自己弟弟的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't underestimate his loyalty to his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说有一举两得的办法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we solve both problems at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把莫尔交给总督 作为谈判砝码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deliver Merle to the Governor. Bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出他的叛徒 或许可以停战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him his traitor, maybe declare a truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那个农场主赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the farmer Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定是那个败类莫尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the black sheep Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎样失掉腿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you lose it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:09:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,被咬 你自己砍掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit? You hack it off yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克砍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是大好人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awful kindly of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我有更多时间陪伴女儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave me more time with my girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你有更多的时间陪你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave you more time with your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,此恩无价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't put a price on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,世道崩乱 还谈什么有价无价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't put a price on anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在其中一个牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}in one of the cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.12,Title,0,0,0,0,,我不止很久没看过《圣经》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost more than the Good Book there for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也迷失了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果你的右手触犯了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And if your right hand offends you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它砍掉 扔的远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut it off, cast it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是有益的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}For it is profitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为其中一个必定消亡「\N{\fnArial\fs30}that one of your members should perish…"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「而不是你的整个身体坠入地狱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And not that thy whole body should be cast into hell."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:12.46,Title,0,0,0,0,,《马太福音》第5章29至30段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matthew 5:29 and 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.25,0:10:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍德伯里有个超赞的图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woodbury had a damn fine library.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所怀念的为数不多的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the only things I miss about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.28,0:10:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当总督再次来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Governor returns,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会先杀掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna kill me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后是米琼恩 我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是你的女儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}then your girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 卡尔 还有那个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Carl, the baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有剩余的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever else is left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后杀瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll save Rick for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他亲眼目睹家人和朋友的惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he can watch his family and friends die ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们要对付的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's who you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是麦克劳德女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mrs. McLeod.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.18,0:11:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有关节炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one with arthritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到其他适合你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll find another way you can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚有哮喘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah's asthmatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你用过枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever shoot a gun, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有过一支BB手枪 被我妈妈没收了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a BB gun once. My mom took it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里可以好好学习了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're gonna learn from the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没来得及说很高兴你能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't had a chance to say I'm glad you came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴什么 回到这烂地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what? All this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what T-Dog called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原以为他是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought he was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}till you found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他虽然是你哥哥 但他对你是毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your brother, but he's not good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让他影响到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him bring you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 我们一起经历了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, look how far you've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们彻底封锁了大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sealed it thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能进出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's getting in or out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要你坦诚相对\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need you to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱的那场战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fight at the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发誓什么也不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you swear you didn't know anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.47,0:13:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会提倡那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't advocate a move like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那纯属泄愤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just posturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那你替我打掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Then you have to cover for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能让总督知道 - 别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the Governor can't know. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去 我曾是他们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to. I was with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我做两难抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't put me in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也希望有其他办法 - 如果他发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wish there was another way. - If he finds out…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a chance we have to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许愿意冒 但我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you do, but I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.81,0:13:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍德伯里成了童兵军营\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woodbury is an armed camp with child soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们成了毫无价值的炮灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cannon fodder in a war over what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难道是你科研的意义吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what all your work is for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 帮我溜出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, help me get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能开车去 他们不会开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take a car. They won't open the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要溜出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to sneak out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想办法到监狱 跟瑞克谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}make my way to the prison, and talk to Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是背叛行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.15,0:14:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是在阻止两败俱伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's an attempt to stop this before more people get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我的 米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this, Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.25,0:14:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我监视她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me to keep tabs on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:14:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要溜回监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going back to the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,并要求我协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has requested my assistance in escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「溜」是她的原话 不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her words, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,协助她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你是真要我协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, do you really want me to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在测试我\N{\fnArial\fs30}or is this some sort of test?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然她要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she asks for help,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Andrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,按住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pin it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.41,0:16:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再多撑一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它头抬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Force it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hold it! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能赶紧完事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we finish this up, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,健身是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart to stay fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有氧训练益处多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave out the cardio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要同住一个屋檐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if we're gonna live under the same roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.07,0:18:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该把话说清\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should clear the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,追杀你那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole hunting you down thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是公事公办\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was just business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,执行命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrying out orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像盖世太保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Like the Gestapo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过很多亏心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done a lot of things I ain't proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,末世前后都做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before and after.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 但愿你能尽释前嫌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, hope we can get past it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,既往不咎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let bygones be bygones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.59,0:19:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像迷彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a diversionary tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能分散行尸注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps the walkers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它们俩怎么照来不误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't work so well with those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有营地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有座镇子 高墙环绕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a town. It's walled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概有七十个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's about 70 of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还收新人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take people in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.51,0:19:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来带他们回去 - 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take them back. - Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果他问起来… - 我会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If he asks, just… - I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起他们来 我更会和总督打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better with him than I am with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这几天历尽磨难\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had a rough couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪里 - 继续巡视\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you going? - Got to finish my run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.18,0:20:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的守护神在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got my guardian angel here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要帮忙吗 - 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Need any help? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边好像不大对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psst Something weird out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去叫你爸爸和其他人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your dad and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.56,0:22:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只有你一个人吗 - 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you alone? - Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.83,0:22:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手 转过身去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up! Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.73,0:22:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 赶快转过身\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Turn around now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你是不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked if you were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.69,0:23:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.79,0:23:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我之后 我们以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you saved me, we thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.77,0:23:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Shane?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.20,0:24:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.57,0:24:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉生了个女孩 可她自己没能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a girl. Lori didn't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.35,0:24:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither did T-Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.84,0:24:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,太遗憾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.74,0:24:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.86,0:24:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.73,0:24:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都住在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.98,0:24:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here and the cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.78,0:24:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.57,0:24:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can I go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.53,0:24:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.00,0:24:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是敌人 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an enemy, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.56,0:24:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,广场和院子本来很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had that field and courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.00,0:24:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你男友开着卡车毁掉了围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}until your boyfriend tore down the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:25:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还开枪扫射我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a truck and shot us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.55,0:25:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是你先开火的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you fired first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.16,0:25:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀死了一个幸存的犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed an inmate who survived in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.17,0:25:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都喜欢他 他是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We liked him. He was one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.18,0:25:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.33,0:25:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一知道就马上赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I found out, I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.35,0:25:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到枪战爆发后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know you were in Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.21,0:25:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才知道你们来到了伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}until after the shoot-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.36,0:25:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是几天前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.15,0:25:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你了 我尽快赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I came as soon as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.76,0:25:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟他们说了什么 - 什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you told them? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂了 我曾和你们一起离开亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. I left Atlanta with you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.85,0:25:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却被排斥在外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I'm the odd man out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差点杀了米琼恩 还可能杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He almost killed Michonne and he would have killed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.22,0:25:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他拿着枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his finger on the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.30,0:25:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是他绑架了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he the one who kidnapped you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还殴打你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who beat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.25,0:25:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.84,0:25:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法为菲利普的所作所为找借口或解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot excuse or explain what Philip has done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.11,0:25:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我来这里就是为了解决僵局\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am here trying to bring us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.15,0:26:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须消除分歧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么分歧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.10,0:26:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.69,0:26:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么杀 何时杀 但我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how or when, but we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.19,0:26:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以解决此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.74,0:26:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍德伯里欢迎你们定居\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is room at Woodbury for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.06,0:26:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是有「切身体会」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为总督会谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think this man wants to negotiate?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.12,0:26:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他亲口说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.89,0:26:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.82,0:26:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.46,0:26:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他正在备战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's gearing up for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.22,0:26:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇民很惊恐 他们把你们当成杀人魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people are terrified. They see you as killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.23,0:26:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在训练 准备进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're training to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.91,0:26:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看这样吧 下次你见到菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what. Next time you see Philip,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.89,0:26:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 另一只眼睛我要定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell him I'm gonna take his other eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.69,0:26:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们忍气吞声太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taken too much shit for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想开战 放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants a war? He's got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.11,0:26:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.77,0:26:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不冷静地解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't sit down and try to work this out,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.64,0:26:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:26:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一城镇的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.87,0:27:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.07,0:27:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经失去了太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost so much already.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.13,0:27:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能再孤立无援了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stand alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.66,0:27:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真想帮我们 就引我们进镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to make this right, get us inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.61,0:27:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 那就没什么好说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Then we got nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.53,0:27:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇里有无辜的百姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.30,0:27:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误导了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You poisoned them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.00,0:27:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是告诉了他们真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just told them the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.07,0:27:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有选他而放弃你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't choose him over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.63,0:27:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要正常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.70,0:27:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们一进伍德伯里 你就充满敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we entered Woodbury, you became hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.47,0:27:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是因为我能看清 - 看清什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's 'cause I could see it. - See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.36,0:27:43.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（从你看到他那一刻 就被迷住了心窍）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.83,0:27:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是真的 - 你依然执迷不悟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is not true. - And you still are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.06,0:27:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我留下是因为镇民需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I am there because those people need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.56,0:27:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这里的人怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.23,0:27:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在试着救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to save them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.03,0:27:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道救世主情结还会传染\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not realize the messiah complex was contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.47,0:28:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell, Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他派莫尔追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sent Merle to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.93,0:28:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你跟我一起走 他也会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have sent him to kill you, too, if you had come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.36,0:28:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没走 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.51,0:28:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了舒适的床而抛弃了朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose a warm bed over a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.45,0:28:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我回伍德伯里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I went back to Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.69,0:28:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要揭穿他的本来面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exposed him for what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.67,0:28:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道真相会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that it would hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.36,0:29:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯蒂文斯医生马上就来为你们检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Stevens will be here soon. We'll get you checked over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.74,0:29:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - It's my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.71,0:29:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想住多久都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're welcome to stay as long as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.31,0:29:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有食物 干净衣物 热水\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got food, fresh clothing, hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.92,0:29:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我们还会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally we'd provide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.10,0:29:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们武器和车辆以备上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}with weapons and a car for your journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.05,0:29:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我们没有富余\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need all we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.10,0:29:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看起来在备战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're battening down the hatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.69,0:29:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被攻击了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you guys attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.81,0:29:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但不是被行尸 而是一群恶徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but not by biters. Some dangerous people out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.23,0:29:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们几天前攻击了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came at us a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.79,0:29:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人受伤吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.67,0:29:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were several fatalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.89,0:29:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 抱歉 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn. Sorry. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.98,0:29:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世道得加倍小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be too careful these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.69,0:29:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能上路后 最好去西边\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're ready to travel, head west.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.90,0:29:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去85号公路以北就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avoid anything north up 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.05,0:29:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚从那边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just came from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.53,0:29:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个监狱里撞见个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran into some whack-job in a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.06,0:29:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.10,0:30:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是 像个白痴似的乱叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Screaming like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.58,0:30:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有点精神错乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little unhinged.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.98,0:30:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是其他人看起来都不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the others seemed decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.18,0:30:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个首领回来前都相安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything seemed cool until their leader came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.71,0:30:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一回来就拿枪指着我鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and practically shoved a gun in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.85,0:30:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去过监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were at the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.46,0:30:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去避难 艾伦的妻子死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went in for shelter. Lost Allen's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.94,0:30:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫瑞克的人突然出现 把我们赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy Rick showed up all of sudden, chased us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.57,0:30:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙收拾他们吗 把我们算上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need help with these guys? We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.63,0:30:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.52,0:30:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该让你们参与我们的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we couldn't ask you to join in our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.24,0:30:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们不想离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we don't want to be out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.71,0:30:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面我们迟早会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a matter of time before…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.11,0:30:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.22,0:30:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能留下 我们做什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we got to do to earn our keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.53,0:30:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到过监狱内部吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you inside the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.14,0:30:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能描述一下它的布局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you describe the layout?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.30,0:30:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺难形容的 不过我尽量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty confusing, but I could try.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.07,0:30:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get your rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.40,0:30:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以明天再谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk about it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.85,0:30:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我所说 你们想留多久都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I say, you're welcome to stay here as long as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.84,0:30:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你们先休息 商量一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you take the night. Talk it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.94,0:31:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.92,0:31:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不能不跟小拽女打个招呼就走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave without meeting Little Ass-Kicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.58,0:31:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能抱抱她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I hold her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.03,0:31:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然可以 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.55,0:31:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱住了吗 - 抱住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got her? - I got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.43,0:31:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.37,0:31:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.05,0:31:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小拽女这名是达里尔起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl named her "Ass-Kicker."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.87,0:31:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是她的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not really her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.43,0:31:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朱迪思 - 朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Judith. - Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.97,0:31:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是多么珍贵啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how precious are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.76,0:31:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,死于剖腹产\N{\fnArial\fs30}During a C-section.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.85,0:31:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.87,0:31:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔不得不… - 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl had to… - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.69,0:31:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔死于我脱险\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-Dog died leading me to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.86,0:31:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那肖恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Shane?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.53,0:31:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.43,0:32:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开农场的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night we left the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰德尔事件完全是个骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whole Randall thing was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.01,0:32:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩试图杀死瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane tried to kill Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.88,0:32:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩是爱瑞克的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane loved Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.87,0:32:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩也爱洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane loved Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.84,0:32:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克变得冷血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick's become cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.55,0:32:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜怒无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unsteady.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.88,0:32:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有他的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.43,0:32:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督那 你得花点心思\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor, you need to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.25,0:32:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.50,0:32:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要和他上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you need to sleep with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他一生中最消魂的一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him the greatest night of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.12,0:32:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他放松警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get him to drop his guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他睡着了 你就可以终结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when he's sleeping, you can end this. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.68,0:33:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车我能开走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you spare it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.08,0:33:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.65,0:33:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.05,0:33:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:34:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.46,0:34:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.93,0:34:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.60,0:35:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.27,0:35:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.72,0:35:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.33,0:35:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.16,0:36:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去监狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.15,0:36:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们溃不成军\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.48,0:36:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,处境十分糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}living in horrible conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.39,0:36:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩在那儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.45,0:36:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.04,0:36:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.92,0:36:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.88,0:36:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.80,0:36:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他派你回来的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He send you back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.47,0:36:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.88,0:36:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己要回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.53,0:36:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.19,0:37:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.51,0:38:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有人在我们镇上竖起块牌子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ They hung a sign up in our town ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.13,0:38:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你快活度日 便不会忘掉耻辱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If you live it up, you won't live it down ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.60,0:38:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 于是她离开了蒙特里欧 孩子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So she left Monte Rio, son ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.22,0:38:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就像一颗子弹离开枪膛 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just like a bullet leaves a gun ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.16,0:38:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 带着深灰色的眼睛和梦露般的臀部 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ With charcoal eyes and Monroe hips ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她走了 踏上了去往加州的旅程 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ She went and took the California trip ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.87,0:38:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那晚月亮如金 她的头发似风 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Well, the moon was gold and her hair like wind ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.81,0:38:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她说 别回头 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Said don't look back now ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.59,0:38:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 跟我走 吉姆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just come on, Jim ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.18,0:38:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你得坚持住 坚持住 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You got to hold on Hold on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.98,0:38:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你得坚持住 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You got to hold on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.98,0:38:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 握着我的手 我就站在这儿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Take my hand, I'm standing right here ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.66,0:38:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你得坚持住 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You got to hold on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.68,0:38:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他曾给过她一块廉价手表 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Well, he gave her a dime-store watch ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.35,0:39:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 和一枚用勺子打造的戒指 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And a ring made from a spoon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.15,0:39:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每个人都在寻找替罪羊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Everyone's looking for someone to blame ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.20,0:39:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当你与我同眠 你便与我同姓… ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If you share my bed, you share my name… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.20,0:39:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算重聚了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some reunion, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.30,0:39:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她左右两难\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in a jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.55,0:39:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.90,0:39:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚说得在理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea's persuasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.77,0:39:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督全副武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fella's armed to the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.22,0:39:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,决心干掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bent on destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.94,0:39:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.06,0:39:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也得准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We match it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.24,0:39:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going on a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.00,0:39:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll head out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.09,0:39:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.95,0:39:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.19,0:39:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你回来了 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're back, really,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.66,0:39:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他惹事了 你得负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if he causes a problem, it's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.36,0:39:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会看好他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.08,0:39:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和米琼恩一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.36,0:39:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这是好主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.53,0:39:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,试了就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.89,0:40:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.83,0:40:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.97,0:40:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管好这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hold it down here.
